sec.p:
A manual quality check was not feasible due to the large volume of data. Therefore, we implemented an automated, standardized data quality control pipeline as described by Hinterberger et al. (2022). All data processing and analysis were performed in the R statistical environment R (version 4.3.3; R Core Team 2024) following the methodology outlined by R Core Team (2024). According to Henderson (1975), a linear mixed model (Eq. 1) was fitted, and a nominal significance level of 0.05 was used to identify outliers based on model residuals.1\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
